// `ieee80211_power.o` member. All sixteen original entry points live in the
// Abla LLVM unit. The three weak SDK fallbacks remain selectable separately
// so a mixed ESP-IDF build keeps the stronger implementations it already
// chose, while a future fully-Abla link can enable them without another port.

